sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: branching-code-review
    participant role_author as Author
    participant role_review_lead as Review lead
    participant role_qa_lead as QA lead
    participant role_security_reviewer as Security reviewer
    participant role_solution_architect as Solution architect
    participant role_merge_approver as Merge approver
    participant system as Branching code review and merge governance
    role_author->>system: Prepare pull request and reviewer brief
    system-->>role_author: evidence -> Pull request readiness packet
    role_review_lead->>system: Route code review disposition
    system-->>role_review_lead: evidence -> Review routing decision record
    Note over system: branches -> Repairs required, QA validation, Security review, Architecture review, Ready for merge, Default, Error
    role_author->>system: Complete focused repair pass
    system-->>role_author: evidence -> Repair brief
    role_qa_lead->>system: Validate QA lane and browser proof
    system-->>role_qa_lead: evidence -> QA lane validation note
    role_security_reviewer->>system: Perform security review before merge
    system-->>role_security_reviewer: evidence -> Security lane review note
    role_solution_architect->>system: Escalate architecture consequences
    system-->>role_solution_architect: evidence -> Architecture escalation brief
    role_merge_approver->>system: Approve direct merge route
    system-->>role_merge_approver: evidence -> Direct merge readiness note
    role_merge_approver->>system: Approve merge after QA validation
    system-->>role_merge_approver: evidence -> QA merge readiness note
    role_merge_approver->>system: Approve merge after security review
    system-->>role_merge_approver: evidence -> Security merge readiness note
    role_merge_approver->>system: Approve merge after architecture escalation
    system-->>role_merge_approver: evidence -> Architecture merge readiness note
    role_review_lead->>system: Normalize default review lane
    system-->>role_review_lead: evidence -> Review normalization note
    role_merge_approver->>system: Approve merge after default normalization
    system-->>role_merge_approver: evidence -> Default-route merge readiness note
    role_review_lead->>system: Capture workflow failure and recovery path
    system-->>role_review_lead: evidence -> Review workflow failure record
